**Advantages of Selenium:**

* Supports **headless execution** for fast CI/CD pipeline runs.
* **Selenium Manager** automatically downloads and configures browser drivers without manual path setup.
* Rich locator strategies (`By.id`, `By.cssSelector`, `By.xpath`) for interacting with dynamic DOM elements.

### 2. JS Calculator (`javscriptCalculator.html`) & Selenium Test (`FirstSeleniumPro2.java`)

**`javscriptCalculator.html`**

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>JS Calculator</title></head>
<body>
  <h2>Simple Calculator</h2>
  <input type="number" id="num1" placeholder="Number 1">
  <input type="number" id="num2" placeholder="Number 2">
  <button id="addBtn" onclick="calculate('+')">Add</button>
  <button id="subBtn" onclick="calculate('-')">Subtract</button>
  <p>Result: <span id="result">0</span></p>

  <script>
    function calculate(op) {
      const a = parseFloat(document.getElementById("num1").value);
      const b = parseFloat(document.getElementById("num2").value);
