### 3. Comparison of Deployment Systems with Configuration Files

| Feature | Traditional / VM Deployment | Docker (Containerized) | Kubernetes (Orchestrated) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Isolation Level** | Full Guest OS per VM (Heavy, GBs) | Shared Host Kernel (Lightweight, MBs) | Multi-node Pod clusters |
| **Startup Time** | Minutes | Milliseconds to seconds | Seconds (with auto-healing) |
| **Scaling** | Manual VM provisioning | Manual `docker run` / Compose scale | Automated Horizontal Pod Autoscaler |
| **Config File** | `Vagrantfile` / Shell Scripts | `Dockerfile` / `docker-compose.yml` | `deployment.yaml` & `service.yaml` |

**Configuration File Snippets:**

1. **Docker Compose (`docker-compose.yml`):**
```yaml
version: "3.8"
